# Guides and notes stay private: of the Markdown files, only README.md is published
*.md
!/README.md

# Student and staff records stay off GitHub. Spreadsheets and CSV files are never published,
# except the blank import templates the portal offers for download (public/templates/).
# "Data templates" is the office's working copy: filled-in files there stay on this computer.
/Data templates/
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.xlsm
*.csv
*.tsv
*.ods
*.numbers
!/public/templates/*.xlsx

